1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,000
In La Mojana, we mapped open water with radar.

2
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:10,000
The Sentinel scenes give context.
NISAR shows the open water.

3
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:15,000
NISAR mapped June open water.

4
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:21,000
In July, the Sentinel-1 threshold missed
some of the open water.

5
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:27,000
The range depends on the threshold.
The dry reference cannot support a change estimate.
